@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Arms3,Eyes1_Normal_Open3,Mouth1_Determined_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そして中庭に死体を置いて、<br>発見したフリをしたんだ。|#0202Trial04_Hiro005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL3,Eyes1_Angry_Open2,Mouth1_Determined_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:直前に中庭の前を通った私を、<br>犯人に仕立て上げるためにね。|#0202Trial04_Hiro006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

